From ebf5c7c024ed192623a1f207062117198d362c2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stew Forster <stew675@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 21:01:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] WIP indexer: the fused indexer top-k op (radix +
 deterministic gather)

Squashed theme commit (7 originals): the missing INDEXER_FILL entry in
GGML_OP_NAME; the full-width count pass dropped (the gather's per-block g/e
counts derive from the radix histograms); block-key sharing in the histograms
and gather (additive==null); the block-level histogram path (blk_cells src +
block-aligned partition); pass1 histogram bins accumulated per block instead of
per cell; the block-pass visible-count atomic warp-reduced; and the gather's
Hillis-Steele scan replaced by a warp-shuffle one.
